      "content": "i know people want to help, but that just makes it worse. it just adds more guilt to everything. it's like... if i'm just a mistake, and i'm hurting them by existing, wouldn't the most selfless thing to do just be to step aside? to stop being the thing that's dragging the name down? it almost feels like the only way to actually protect them is to just not be a part of it anymore.",
